# SLICE-01c: DesertCtl `set` names ANY Asset<T> reference by its `assets:` path - the slot's content kind is derived from
# the content census (ContentKindForAssetType: <KindName>Asset), not a hand list - and a path of the wrong kind is
# refused with its reason (--expect-refusal; the reason lands in editor.log as "[Control] set ... refused").
# The cube (Primitive Cube, slot 0 = Starter_Prop) gets another mesh and another material, then a texture as its material.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,60,450
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.1,-1
Когда set 6018453462564557835 StaticMesh.Mesh assets:Meshes/Modeling/Blockout.stmesh
Когда set 6018453462564557835 StaticMesh.Materials assets:Materials/CB_Red.demat
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид 0_swapped the cube entity shows the other mesh in the red CB material, not the grey Starter_Prop cube
Когда --expect-refusal set 6018453462564557835 StaticMesh.Materials assets:Textures/T_Checker.detex
Когда advance 1
Тогда-вид 1_refused unchanged from 0_swapped; editor.log has "[Control] set ... refused: 'assets:Textures/T_Checker.detex' is a Texture, not a Material"
